<title>USA: RailTex January carloadings up 14.9 pct.</title>
<headline>RailTex January carloadings up 14.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>RailTex Inc said Thursday that January carloadings increased 14.9 percent to 30,912 from 26,905 in January 1996.</p>
<p>On a &quot;same railroad&quot; basis, carloadings rose 2.9 percent to 27,347 in January 1997 from 26,566 in January 1996, the company said.</p>
</text>
